# Day 9: Lightning Web Components (LWC) Communication & Advanced Layouts

Welcome to the Day 9 project repository! This module dives deep into component orchestration, handling data flow between decoupled components, designing complex dashboard layouts, and contrasting modern LWC architecture with legacy Aura paradigms.

